menuconfig ATTESTATION
	tristate "Attestation framework"
	depends on CTLV
	help
	  Provides a CTLV family for evidence, measurement registers,
	  device-security transitions, and an append-only measurement journal.

	  Providers register one instance for a physical or logical device and
	  translate the common operations to their native service.

	  If you are unsure, say N.

if ATTESTATION

config ATTESTATION_SIM
	tristate "Simulated attestation provider"
	depends on DEBUG_FS
	select CRYPTO_SHA256
	select CRYPTO_SHA512
	help
	  Provides synthetic evidence, measurement registers and device-security
	  state for the attestation selftests. Fixtures are created through
	  debugfs or, when built in, with the early_fixture module parameter.

	  This provider offers no hardware security.

	  If you are unsure, say N.

endif # ATTESTATION
